  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental activities only (no business-type funds). Receipts/disbursements from p4 governmental funds Total column; Taxes 8,683,033 split using p2 general receipts (property, motor vehicle, lodging, other; sum agrees). Local 2,697,636 split using p2 (charges for services 1,798,848, interest 408,532, miscellaneous 404,256) plus the Minority Health Initiative fund's Local 86,000 (p7), which p2 counts as an operating grant; sum agrees. 'Intergovernmental' not itemized. Debt proceeds = lease 251,280 + bond 1,273,173. Transfers in and out both 3,072,191 on p4. Balance sheet is the p1 Statement of Net Position - Cash Basis (no liabilities). Detail: General Fund recorded from the p11 budget schedule (General Fund column only; p5 combining General Fund page not duplicated except the Inheritance Tax Fund column, which is not on p11). p11 department lines include capital outlay/debt (departments sum to 10,577,807, while function lines on p4 differ). Nonmajor funds (more than 6) recorded using the p10 Total Nonmajor column; p6-9 per-fund pages not duplicated. Road, ARPA and Insurance fund disbursements are single printed lines. Read pages 1-14 of 14."
